== Effects ==
* Identifies all [[pills]] upon pickup.
* Spawns a pill.
* Replenishes 2 {{e|Red Heart}}s.
* Increases the payout of {{M|Blood Donation Machine}}s to 2-3 [[coins]] on Normal mode and 2 on [[Hard mode]].
* {{dlc|nr}} Increases the payout of {{i|IV Bag}} to 2-3 [[coins]].
* {{dlc|r}} Increases the payout of {{i|IV Bag}} to 2-3 [[coins]] on Normal mode and 2 on [[Hard mode]].
* Converts some "bad" pills into their "good" counterparts or removes their bad effects:

